{"title":"2010 CEMC Pascal Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of the following is closest in value to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c78cd0de09afc053c5a7244659a936a9c59df2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/e/5be5af739ab3d0a938c0c57a3701fef64134979a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\$0.50 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\$0.90 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\$0.95 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\$1.01 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\$1.15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"550\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Pascal_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the positive difference of each number when subtracted by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c78cd0de09afc053c5a7244659a936a9c59df2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$1.00$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"40\" height=\"14\" /> using the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Absolute_value\" title=\"Absolute value\">absolute value</a> function, and see what the lowest number is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/4/a94253dc68c976f625798e9c56c1dde084b4a67c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\$0.50 - \\$1.00| = |-\\$0.50| = \\$0.50$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"281\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f88745e7b776055bbe64308eba3d5682befc4dbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\$0.90 - \\$1.00| = |-\\$0.10| = \\$0.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"281\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/a/d5af89e3b5ecb126ae321b767651ca3ab3838e70.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\$0.95 - \\$1.00| = |-\\$0.05| = \\$0.05$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"281\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/f/c1fe162ee96b596d0da7b8d3bd0e819296c342dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\$1.01 - \\$1.00| = |\\$0.01| = \\$0.01$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"258\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/a/80a6f0eb592b2859bf1e6871486b4d638e9b71dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|\\$1.15 - \\$1.00| = |\\$0.15| = \\$0.15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"258\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>The smallest difference came from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/4/2d45f3e2c31da111c18268ba543c0cea5a718acf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {\\textbf {(D) } \\$0.01}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"90\" height=\"31\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Pascal\" title=\"2010 CEMC Pascal\">2010 CEMC Pascal</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Pascal_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Pascal Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_CEMC_Pascal_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2010 CEMC Pascal Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc